  "title": {
    "rendered": "Custom Prefab Structures in NCR: Tailored Steel Buildings"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p>If you need a building that goes up fast and is built to your exact requirement, <strong>custom prefab structures in NCR</strong> are a practical answer. Factory-built steel-frame units are designed to your layout, delivered to your Delhi-NCR site and assembled quickly — with far less disruption than conventional construction.</p>\n<p>SAMAN POS India Private Limited manufactures factory-built steel structures (since 2009; incorporated 2019) to <strong>IS 2062</strong> standards, with a unit at <strong>Jalpura, Greater Noida 201308</strong> serving the NCR.</p>\n<h2>What “Customised” Means in Prefab</h2>\n<p>You choose the size, internal layout, openings, insulation level, cladding and finishes. The structure is then fabricated as panels and modules in the factory and assembled on site.</p>\n<h2>Applications Across NCR</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Residential:</strong> homes, additional rooms, farmhouse units.</li>\n<li><strong>Commercial:</strong> offices, showrooms, site and project offices.</li>\n<li><strong>Industrial:</strong> stores, workshops and ancillary buildings.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For NCR industrial belts like Manesar, IMT Faridabad, and the Greater Noida industrial zones, the most common requests are site offices, worker facilities, and ancillary storage buildings that need to go up quickly between production schedules. Because the panels and modules are fabricated at our Jalpura, Greater Noida unit and trucked the short distance into NCR, site time is kept to days rather than weeks.</p>\n<h2>Why NCR Buyers Choose Prefab</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Faster to build than masonry, with less on-site mess and labour.</li>\n<li>Consistent factory quality control.</li>\n<li>Relocatable and expandable as needs change.</li>\n<li>Local Greater Noida base for delivery across Delhi-NCR.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Materials &amp; Build Standard</h2>\n<p>Structures use an MS steel frame to IS 2062 with insulated wall and roof panels for thermal comfort in Delhi’s summers and winters. Finishes and cladding are selected to suit the use.</p>\n<h2>Cost &amp; Timelines</h2>\n<p>Price depends on size, specification and site work, so we quote per design rather than a fixed figure.</p>\n<p>Cover: <strong>5 years on the structural frame and base, 1–2 years on finishing, and a 20–25 year engineered service life</strong>. Standard delivery ₹3,000; transit 3–5 days.</p>\n<h2>Plan Your Custom Prefab Structure in NCR</h2>\n<p>Send your size and location. <strong>Call +91 88616 22859</strong> or use <strong>Send Enquiry</strong>.</p>\n<p>Explore our <a href=\"https://www.samanportable.com/product-category/prefab-buildings\">prefab building range</a>, or see <a href=\"https://www.samanportable.com/product/prefab-buildings/modular-office-buildings\">modular office buildings</a> for a configurable office system.</p>\n<h2>FAQs: Custom Prefab Structures in NCR</h2>\n<br>\n<h3>What can be customised?</h3>\n<p>Size, internal layout, openings, insulation, cladding and finishes — designed to your requirement.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>How quickly can you deliver in NCR?</h3>\n<p>From the Greater Noida (Jalpura) base, units are delivered across Delhi-NCR; standard delivery is ₹3,000 with 3–5 day transit. Exact timing is confirmed per order.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>What does a custom prefab structure cost?</h3>\n<p>It is quoted per design based on size and specification.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>Are prefab structures durable in Delhi weather?</h3>\n<p>Yes — a steel frame to IS 2062 with insulated panels handles NCR’s heat and cold, with a 20–25 year engineered service life.</p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>Custom prefab structures in NCR — tailored steel-frame buildings for homes, offices and industry, delivered from a Greater Noida factory. Get a quote.</p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
